  "question": {
    "text": "A truck is moving with a constant velocity of 54 km/h. In which direction (angle with the direction of motion of track) should a stone be projected up with a velocity of 20 m/s, from the floor of the truck, so as to appear at right angles to the truck, for a person standing on the earth ?"
